<title>CANADA: Canada dollar ended stronger in heavy flows.</title>
<headline>Canada dollar ended stronger in heavy flows.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3530/1.3565	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3607</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3530   SUPPORT 1.3620	HI 1.3613   LO  1.3577</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3580/85    HI 1.3596     EUROPE OPEN     1.3604</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3593/98    LO 1.3532     HI 1.3610   LO  1.3574</p>
<p>-----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------</p>
<p>* The Canadian dollar closed stronger in very heavy flows at C$1.3545 (US$0.7383) on Friday from Thursday's close of C$1.3593 (US$0.7357). * Rallies in North American equity and fixed income markets boosted unit. * Many fund managers becoming buyers, attracted by Canada's strong fundamentals.</p>
<p>* Range of C$1.3530-C$1.3565 seen in Asia late Sunday.</p>
